    "Name": "Svartalfa 2",
    "Details": "Originally rumored to be a light or ultralight LAM, the Svartalfa was a well-kept secret until its live-fire test against Clan Wolf where it saw great success. At first confusing the Wolves as to what it was -- too small to be a 'Mech, too large to be a Proto or battle armor -- the defending Wolf warriors were forced into deploying medium and heavy 'Mechs to deal with even a single Svartalfa. This variant replaces all the stock weaponry along with some armor for a pair of LRM-15 Launchers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Resilient</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.986</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Protomech_Svartalfa_Standard"
